---
description: Security rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never hardcode secrets, keys, passwords, or tokens. Read from environment via config.py.
- Only .env.example (placeholder values) is committed.
- Hash passwords with argon2. Sessions in httpOnly Secure SameSite=Lax cookies. CSRF on all state-changing requests.
- Validate every input server-side with Pydantic. Enforce roles on the server.
- Encrypt stored third-party API keys with Fernet (APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY). Never return them to the client; return a masked value only.
- Rate-limit auth, signup, reset, and bug-report endpoints.
- Award XP and badges only on the server.
